Provenance
----------
The service-6 (xmatch) message layouts in internal/xmatch follow the public Xombie codec
(libs/xblive/src/service/matchmaking.rs, https://github.com/XombieOnline/xombie, AGPL-3.0,
base commit 7a1ef08045271437efc5938c996cb0c209a31408), cross-checked against the original
Xbox dashboard (xonlinedash.xbe 5960) by static analysis; no code is copied, the test vector
for the search header is the one in Xombie's tests. The voice chat behaviour is documented in
OpenPak's internal research notes.

No Insignia, leaked Microsoft source or other third-party proprietary material was used.
Shared contracts live in https://github.com/openpak/xb-common; the neutral voice session
service this adapter calls is https://github.com/openpak/voice.
